    "%@'s files are removed from this Mac. It isn't in the gallery now, so you may not be able to download it again." : {
      "comment" : "Removing a companion the gallery no longer offers",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُزال ملفات %@ من هذا الـ Mac. لم يعد في المعرض، لذا قد لا تتمكن من تنزيله مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Dateien von %@ werden von diesem Mac entfernt. Der Begleiter ist nicht mehr in der Galerie, du kannst ihn also vielleicht nicht erneut laden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los archivos de %@ se quitan de este Mac. Ya no está en la galería, así que quizá no puedas volver a descargarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les fichiers de %@ sont retirés de ce Mac. Ce compagnon n'est plus dans la galerie : vous ne pourrez peut-être pas le télécharger à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I file di %@ vengono rimossi da questo Mac. Non è più nella galleria, quindi potresti non riuscire a scaricarlo di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@のファイルをこのMacから削除します。ギャラリーにはもうないため、再ダウンロードできない場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@의 파일이 이 Mac에서 제거돼요. 이제 갤러리에 없어서 다시 다운로드하지 못할 수도 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os arquivos de %@ são removidos deste Mac. Ele não está mais na galeria, então talvez você não consiga baixá-lo de novo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的文件将从这台 Mac 上移除。它已不在画廊中，你可能无法再次下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@'s files are removed from this Mac. You can download it again from the gallery at any time." : {
