          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a link at ~/.local/bin/sidefolk so you can type “sidefolk run -- npm test” in a terminal. Nothing else changes. If ~/.local/bin isn't on your PATH, add this line to ~/.zshrc:" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يضيف رابطًا في ~/.local/bin/sidefolk لتتمكن من كتابة «sidefolk run -- npm test» في Terminal. لا يتغيّر شيء آخر. إذا لم يكن ~/.local/bin ضمن PATH لديك، فأضف هذا السطر إلى ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legt unter ~/.local/bin/sidefolk einen Link an, damit du „sidefolk run -- npm test“ im Terminal eingeben kannst. Sonst ändert sich nichts. Wenn ~/.local/bin nicht in deinem PATH ist, füge diese Zeile zu ~/.zshrc hinzu:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade un enlace en ~/.local/bin/sidefolk para que puedas escribir “sidefolk run -- npm test” en un terminal. No cambia nada más. Si ~/.local/bin no está en tu PATH, añade esta línea a ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoute un lien dans ~/.local/bin/sidefolk pour que vous puissiez taper « sidefolk run -- npm test » dans un terminal. Rien d’autre ne change. Si ~/.local/bin n’est pas dans votre PATH, ajoutez cette ligne à ~/.zshrc :"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiunge un link in ~/.local/bin/sidefolk, così puoi digitare “sidefolk run -- npm test” in un terminale. Nient'altro cambia. Se ~/.local/bin non è nel tuo PATH, aggiungi questa riga a ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.local/bin/sidefolkにリンクを追加し、ターミナルで「sidefolk run -- npm test」と入力できるようにします。ほかには何も変更しません。~/.local/binがPATHに含まれていない場合は、次の行を~/.zshrcに追加してください："
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/.local/bin/sidefolk에 링크를 추가해서 터미널에서 “sidefolk run -- npm test”를 입력할 수 있게 해요. 다른 것은 바뀌지 않아요. ~/.local/bin이 PATH에 없으면 ~/.zshrc에 다음 줄을 추가하세요:"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adiciona um link em ~/.local/bin/sidefolk para você digitar “sidefolk run -- npm test” num terminal. Nada mais muda. Se ~/.local/bin não estiver no seu PATH, adicione esta linha ao ~/.zshrc:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ~/.local/bin/sidefolk 添加一个链接，这样你就可以在终端里输入“sidefolk run -- npm test”。其他都不会改变。如果 ~/.local/bin 不在你的 PATH 中，请把下面这一行添加到 ~/.zshrc："
