    "Asks when, then reminds you of it." : {
      "comment" : "The drop card: what Remind me does with text",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يسأل متى، ثم يذكّرك به."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fragt, wann, und erinnert dich dann daran."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta cuándo y luego te lo recuerda."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demande quand, puis vous le rappelle."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chiede quando, poi te lo ricorda."
          }
