    "Its AI's notices, routines and its own remarks. Its questions always come." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Attention: under the companion's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تنبيهات ذكائه الاصطناعي وروتيناته وملاحظاته الخاصة. أسئلته تصل دائمًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hinweise seiner KI, Routinen und eigene Bemerkungen. Seine Fragen kommen immer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los avisos de su IA, sus rutinas y sus propios comentarios. Sus preguntas siempre llegan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les notifications de son IA, ses routines et ses propres remarques. Ses questions arrivent toujours."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli avvisi della sua IA, le routine e le sue osservazioni. Le sue domande arrivano sempre."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI のお知らせ、ルーティン、自分からのひとこと。質問はいつも届きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI의 알림, 루틴, 스스로 하는 말. 질문은 늘 와요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os avisos da IA dele, as rotinas e os próprios comentários. As perguntas dele sempre chegam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的 AI 通知、例行任务和它自己的话。它的问题总会送达。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its checks and the text it kept are deleted with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُحذف فحوصها والنص الذي احتفظت به معها."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Prüfungen und der gespeicherte Text werden mit ihr gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus comprobaciones y el texto que guardó se borran con ella."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ses vérifications et le texte gardé sont supprimés avec elle."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I suoi controlli e il testo conservato vengono eliminati con lei."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確認の記録と保存したテキストも一緒に削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "확인 기록과 저장한 텍스트도 함께 삭제됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As verificações e o texto guardado são apagados junto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的检查记录和保存的文本会一并删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its disk image goes to your Downloads folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُحفظ صورة القرص الخاصة به في مجلد التنزيلات لديك."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Festplattenabbild landet in deinem Ordner „Downloads“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su imagen de disco va a tu carpeta Descargas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son image disque va dans votre dossier Téléchargements."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sua immagine disco va nella cartella Download."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスクイメージは「ダウンロード」フォルダに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "디스크 이미지는 다운로드 폴더에 저장돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A imagem de disco vai para a sua pasta Downloads."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的磁盘映像会存放到“下载”文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its eyes, ear lights and what it wears." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "العينان وأضواء الأذنين والملابس."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Augen, Ohrenlichter und Outfit."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus ojos, las luces de las orejas y lo que lleva puesto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ses yeux, les lumières de ses oreilles et sa tenue."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I suoi occhi, le luci delle orecchie e ciò che indossa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目、耳のライト、身につけているもの。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "눈, 귀 조명, 착용한 것."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os olhos, as luzes das orelhas e o acessório."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的眼睛、耳朵灯光和穿戴的东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its files changed since you installed it (%@) Install it again to use it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تغيّرت ملفاته منذ تثبيته (%@). ثبّته مجددًا لاستخدامه."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Dateien haben sich seit der Installation geändert (%@) Installiere sie erneut, um sie zu verwenden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus archivos han cambiado desde que la instalaste (%@) Vuelve a instalarla para usarla."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ses fichiers ont changé depuis son installation (%@). Réinstallez-la pour l’utiliser."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I suoi file sono cambiati da quando l'hai installata (%@) Installala di nuovo per usarla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "インストール後にファイルが変更されました（%@）。使うにはもう一度インストールしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "설치한 후 파일이 변경되었어요(%@) 사용하려면 다시 설치하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os arquivos mudaram desde a instalação (%@) Instale de novo para usar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自你安装以来，它的文件已被更改（%@）。重新安装后才能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its files changed since you installed it (%@). Install it again to use it." : {
